data: {"id":"gen-1794252893-RhtIVku7ffaNPE8j4lJQ","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794252893,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Evaluating Agent Count**\n\nI've examined the agent count, which seems reasonable for the given task: information retrieval, tool use, research, and verification. While four agents – Local\\_Knowledge\\_Expert, Computer\\_terminal, Fitness\\_Expert, and Verification\\_Expert – might be a bit high, the manual fallback justifies their presence. I'm noting the clear hand-off and problem-solving, like the Fitness\\_Expert taking over when the tool fails, but I will investigate the role transition between Fitness Expert and Local Knowledge Expert a bit more closely.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Evaluating Agent Count**\n\nI've examined the agent count, which seems reasonable for the given task: information retrieval, tool use, research, and verification. While four agents – Local\\_Knowledge\\_Expert, Computer\\_terminal, Fitness\\_Expert, and Verification\\_Expert – might be a bit high, the manual fallback justifies their presence. I'm noting the clear hand-off and problem-solving, like the Fitness\\_Expert taking over when the tool fails, but I will investigate the role transition between Fitness Expert and Local Knowledge Expert a bit more closely.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

